OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe clear spells this evening with
OL,7,Flight winds, allowing temperatures to
OL,8,Fquickly fall for a chilly night. Fog
OL,9,Fstarting to form before midnight,
OL,10,Fbecoming extensive inland by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDense fog inland may be slow
OL,13,Fto clear tomorrow morning, in some
OL,14,Fareas. Some bright spells developing,
OL,15,Fbut becoming more cloudy with light
OL,16,Fshowers arriving in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
